{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/4b752766ff5f7dd94b6516f39cc27ce5.avif?t=1773311846\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras_big/4b752766ff5f7dd94b6516f39cc27ce5.avif?t=1773311846 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Football: The Beautiful Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;If you're going to try, go all the way. Otherwise, don't even start.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>--- Charles Bukowski</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/f4fb9bf163747643b8e07331a49fa4cc.avif?t=1773311846\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your dream job, at Ocean City Football Club, awaits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a freshly graduated sports scientist who has landed a dream job at an elite women's football team. You are suddenly thrust into the bustling, glamorous, and competitive world that is Ocean City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/b5971bb6880f832dab551ce710397c63.avif?t=1773311846\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you will form alliances, unknowingly create enemies, and learn valuable lessons about ambition, loyalty, and ultimately about yourself and what you are prepared to do to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/7d86177bcd842cf282ab014366e18ff4.avif?t=1773311846\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a strongly story-based Adult Visual Novel set in the unusual and fascinating world of women's professional football (soccer). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/34421259a672f806ecb84b5072b89479.avif?t=1773311846\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your choices in the game, you will have the chance to act as a catalyst for your club reclaiming its past glories, and stand proudly with those you love. You can also choose another path, one that not only exposes you to the dark underbelly of professional sport, but one that tempts you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/de82049afc0c404c38d1af598c58e011.poster.avif?t=1773311846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/de82049afc0c404c38d1af598c58e011.webm?t=1773311846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/de82049afc0c404c38d1af598c58e011.mp4?t=1773311846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Football, as with life, is a game of inches. A couple of inches too far to the left or too far to the right, and you lose. Every inch matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/1d4513a62c06564de47e999641099b19.poster.avif?t=1773311846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263540/extras/1d4513a62c06564de47e999641099b19.webm?t=1773311846\" type=\"video/